#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.5"
msgstr "v4.4.5"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.5 adds firmware loading and recovery for the new Alif Ensemble (OpenMV "
"Cam AE3) boards, ships complete localized UI translations across the full "
"bundled language set, and grows the bundled model zoo with a large DeGirum "
"collection and a new Qualcomm AI Hub vendor section. The release stays on "
"the Qt Creator 14.0.2 base. A few menu items and developer command-line "
"options were removed; see :ref:`Breaking changes <changelog_ide_v4_4_5>`."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.5 menambahkan pemuatan firmware dan pemulihan untuk board Alif Ensemble"
" (OpenMV Cam AE3) baru, menyertakan terjemahan UI yang dilokalisasi secara "
"lengkap di seluruh set bahasa yang dibundel, dan memperluas model zoo yang "
"dibundel dengan koleksi DeGirum yang besar serta bagian vendor Qualcomm AI "
"Hub baru. Rilis ini tetap pada basis Qt Creator 14.0.2. Beberapa item menu "
"dan opsi command-line pengembang dihapus; lihat :ref:`Breaking changes "
"<changelog_ide_v4_4_5>`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Highlights"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Alif Ensemble (OpenMV Cam AE3) support** lets you load and recover "
"firmware on the new AE3 boards directly from the IDE, including a guided "
"recovery flow for bricked boards."
msgstr ""
"**Dukungan Alif Ensemble (OpenMV Cam AE3)** memungkinkan Anda memuat dan "
"memulihkan firmware pada board AE3 baru langsung dari IDE, termasuk alur "
"pemulihan terpandu untuk board yang rusak."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Localized UI translations** are now complete across the full bundled "
"language set, including OpenMV-specific dialog strings."
msgstr ""
"**Terjemahan UI yang dilokalisasi** kini lengkap di seluruh set bahasa yang "
"dibundel, termasuk string dialog khusus OpenMV."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:27
msgid ""
"**DeGirum model zoo** adds a large collection of YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n "
"variants plus a new Model Zoo landing page."
msgstr ""
"**Model zoo DeGirum** menambahkan koleksi besar varian "
"YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n ditambah halaman landing Model Zoo baru."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Qualcomm AI Hub models** add a new Qualcomm vendor section with 16 "
"quantized models across 15 model families (YOLOv8-Detection, Yolo-NAS, "
"Yolo-v7, DeepLabV3+ MobileNet, MediaPipe Face, MiDaS, MobileNet v2/v3, "
"PoseNet, ShuffleNet v2, SqueezeNet, GoogLeNet, and more), plus new Qualcomm "
"and Google vendor landing pages."
msgstr ""
"**Model Qualcomm AI Hub** menambahkan bagian vendor Qualcomm baru dengan 16 "
"model terkuantisasi di 15 keluarga model (YOLOv8-Detection, Yolo-NAS, "
"Yolo-v7, DeepLabV3+ MobileNet, MediaPipe Face, MiDaS, MobileNet v2/v3, "
"PoseNet, ShuffleNet v2, SqueezeNet, GoogLeNet, dan lainnya), ditambah "
"halaman landing vendor Qualcomm dan Google baru."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Camera USB drive matching** now selects the exact removable drive for the "
"connected camera by serial number on Windows, Linux, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"**Pencocokan drive USB kamera** kini memilih drive yang dapat dilepas dengan"
" tepat untuk kamera yang terhubung berdasarkan nomor seri di Windows, Linux,"
" dan macOS."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:36
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when the helloworld script was rewritten for the connected "
"sensor."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki crash saat skrip helloworld ditulis ulang untuk sensor yang "
"terhubung."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:40
msgid "New features"
msgstr "New features"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:42
msgid ""
"Added the ability to load and recover firmware on the new Alif Ensemble "
"(**OpenMV Cam AE3**) boards directly from the IDE, using bundled Alif "
"command-line tools and a dedicated UART/DFU recovery bootloader. The flow "
"uses an internal, hidden ``OpenMV Cam AE3 SBL`` board entry (VID:PID "
"``37C5:16E3``) that is not exposed as a selectable board in the connection "
"dropdown (`e896a475b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e896a475b>`__, `c386a2680 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c386a2680>`__, `b2834df07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2834df07>`__, `2df2a5535 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2df2a5535>`__, `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan kemampuan untuk memuat dan memulihkan firmware pada board Alif "
"Ensemble (\\ **OpenMV Cam AE3**\\ ) baru langsung dari IDE, menggunakan alat"
" command-line Alif yang dibundel dan bootloader pemulihan UART/DFU khusus. "
"Alur ini menggunakan entri board internal tersembunyi ``OpenMV Cam AE3 SBL``"
" (VID:PID ``37C5:16E3``\\ ) yang tidak diekspos sebagai board yang dapat "
"dipilih di dropdown koneksi (\\ `e896a475b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e896a475b>`__\\ , `c386a2680 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c386a2680>`__\\ , `b2834df07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2834df07>`__\\ , `2df2a5535 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2df2a5535>`__\\ , `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:53
msgid ""
"Corrupted or bricked Alif boards can now be reset and re-flashed via a "
"guided recovery flow that prompts you to enable the hard maintenance mode "
"switch (if not already on) and press the board's user button during the "
"maintenance-mode handshake (`ec69240ab <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ec69240ab>`__, `2fb7f9fde <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2fb7f9fde>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Board Alif yang rusak atau tidak dapat di-boot kini dapat direset dan di-"
"flash ulang melalui alur pemulihan terpandu yang meminta Anda mengaktifkan "
"saklar mode pemeliharaan keras (jika belum aktif) dan menekan tombol "
"pengguna board selama handshake mode pemeliharaan (\\ `ec69240ab "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ec69240ab>`__\\ , `2fb7f9fde "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2fb7f9fde>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:59
msgid ""
"OpenMV IDE now ships complete localized UI translations across its full "
"bundled language set, including OpenMV-specific dialog strings, generated "
"via a new auto-translation pipeline (`60228d5cb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/60228d5cb>`__, `b2e8cece4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2e8cece4>`__, `5d5fc17e9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d5fc17e9>`__, `5d2ad4e64 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d2ad4e64>`__, `43453aadd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/43453aadd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV IDE kini menyertakan terjemahan UI yang dilokalisasi secara lengkap "
"di seluruh set bahasa yang dibundel, termasuk string dialog khusus OpenMV, "
"yang dihasilkan melalui pipeline terjemahan otomatis baru (\\ `60228d5cb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/60228d5cb>`__\\ , `b2e8cece4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2e8cece4>`__\\ , `5d5fc17e9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d5fc17e9>`__\\ , `5d2ad4e64 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d2ad4e64>`__\\ , `43453aadd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/43453aadd>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:67
msgid ""
"Added a large **DeGirum** model-zoo collection (YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n "
"variants for car, coco, face, hand, license-plate, person, age, gender, "
"fruit, ppe, head, and pose/keypoint detection) plus a new Model Zoo landing "
"page (`e39989251 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e39989251>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan koleksi model zoo **DeGirum** yang besar (varian "
"YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n untuk deteksi mobil, coco, wajah, tangan, pelat "
"nomor, orang, usia, gender, buah, APD, kepala, dan pose/keypoint) ditambah "
"halaman landing Model Zoo baru (\\ `e39989251 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e39989251>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:71
msgid ""
"Added a new **Qualcomm AI Hub** vendor section with 16 quantized models "
"across 15 model families (``YOLOv8-Detection``, ``Yolo-NAS``, ``Yolo-v7``, "
"``deeplabv3_plus_mobilenet``, ``foot_track_net``, ``gear_guard_net``, "
"``googlenet``, ``mediapipe_face`` detector and landmark detector, ``midas``,"
" ``mobilenet_v2``, ``mobilenet_v3_large``, ``posenet_mobilenet``, "
"``shufflenet_v2``, and ``squeezenet1_1``), added new Qualcomm and Google "
"vendor landing pages, and reorganized Google MobileNet v1 models out of a "
"``classification`` subfolder (`2fbb806bd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2fbb806bd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan bagian vendor **Qualcomm AI Hub** baru dengan 16 model "
"terkuantisasi di 15 keluarga model (\\ ``YOLOv8-Detection``\\ , ``Yolo-"
"NAS``\\ , ``Yolo-v7``\\ , ``deeplabv3_plus_mobilenet``\\ , "
"``foot_track_net``\\ , ``gear_guard_net``\\ , ``googlenet``\\ , "
"``mediapipe_face`` detektor dan detektor landmark, ``midas``\\ , "
"``mobilenet_v2``\\ , ``mobilenet_v3_large``\\ , ``posenet_mobilenet``\\ , "
"``shufflenet_v2``\\ , dan ``squeezenet1_1``\\ ), menambahkan halaman landing"
" vendor Qualcomm dan Google baru, dan mengorganisir ulang model Google "
"MobileNet v1 dari subfolder ``classification`` (\\ `2fbb806bd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2fbb806bd>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:82
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Other changes and improvements"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:84
msgid ""
"When copying scripts to a camera's USB drive, the IDE now selects the exact "
"removable drive belonging to the connected camera by matching its serial "
"number, instead of guessing among all mounted FAT volumes, on Windows, "
"Linux, and macOS (`ef28da191 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ef28da191>`__, `db98bc4b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/db98bc4b0>`__, `9ee631e6f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ee631e6f>`__, `d6b2a0976 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d6b2a0976>`__, `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Saat menyalin skrip ke drive USB kamera, IDE kini memilih drive yang dapat "
"dilepas milik kamera yang terhubung dengan mencocokkan nomor serinya, alih-"
"alih menebak di antara semua volume FAT yang terpasang, di Windows, Linux, "
"dan macOS (\\ `ef28da191 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ef28da191>`__\\ , `db98bc4b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/db98bc4b0>`__\\ , `9ee631e6f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ee631e6f>`__\\ , `d6b2a0976 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d6b2a0976>`__\\ , `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:93
msgid ""
"Drive/USB serial-number lookups and serial-port scanning were moved onto the"
" existing drive-scan worker thread so the IDE UI stays responsive during "
"connection (`bcc78d48e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bcc78d48e>`__, `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Pencarian nomor seri Drive/USB dan pemindaian port serial dipindahkan ke "
"thread worker pemindaian drive yang ada sehingga UI IDE tetap responsif "
"selama koneksi (\\ `bcc78d48e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bcc78d48e>`__\\ , `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:98
msgid ""
"Added initial (currently disabled) plumbing for a variable ``get_state`` "
"payload size that would distinguish high-speed (511 bytes) from full-speed "
"(63 bytes) USB. The code is present but gated off via an ``if (0)`` branch, "
"so ``get_state`` still uses the original fixed 64-byte payload and there is "
"no user-visible behavior change in this release (`31c2e2990 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/31c2e2990>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan saluran awal (saat ini dinonaktifkan) untuk ukuran payload "
"``get_state`` variabel yang akan membedakan high-speed (511 byte) dari full-"
"speed (63 byte) USB. Kode tersebut ada tetapi diblokir melalui cabang ``if "
"(0)``\\ , sehingga ``get_state`` masih menggunakan payload tetap 64-byte "
"asli dan tidak ada perubahan perilaku yang terlihat pengguna dalam rilis ini"
" (\\ `31c2e2990 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/31c2e2990>`__\\"
" )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:104
msgid ""
"Corrected the flash-erase address for the Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect "
"(legacy) bootloader from ``0x10800000`` to ``0x10200000`` (`132047c14 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/132047c14>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki alamat flash-erase untuk bootloader Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect "
"(legacy) dari ``0x10800000`` menjadi ``0x10200000`` (\\ `132047c14 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/132047c14>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:107
msgid ""
"Removed the **CNN Network Library** tool that copied a model file to the "
"OpenMV Cam from the ``Machine Vision Tools`` menu (`07f83ce69 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/07f83ce69>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus alat **CNN Network Library** yang menyalin berkas model ke OpenMV "
"Cam dari menu ``Machine Vision Tools`` (\\ `07f83ce69 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/07f83ce69>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:110
msgid ""
"Hid the camera ``Configure Settings`` dialog menu action (`064fb3d83 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/064fb3d83>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menyembunyikan aksi menu dialog kamera ``Configure Settings`` (\\ `064fb3d83"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/064fb3d83>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:112
msgid ""
"Removed several developer/debug command-line options (``-settingspath``, "
"``-installsettingspath``, ``-pluginpath``, and "
"``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs``) from the application, leaving only "
"``-language`` for end users (`86d009d65 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/86d009d65>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus beberapa opsi command-line developer/debug (\\ ``-settingspath``\\"
" , ``-installsettingspath``\\ , ``-pluginpath``\\ , dan "
"``-temporarycleansettings``\\ /\\ ``-tcs``\\ ) dari aplikasi, hanya "
"menyisakan ``-language`` untuk pengguna akhir (\\ `86d009d65 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/86d009d65>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:119
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bug fixes"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:121
msgid ""
"Fixed an IDE crash that occurred when the helloworld script was rewritten "
"for the connected sensor; the file is now reloaded from disk instead of "
"calling ``setPlainText`` (`5793b3120 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5793b3120>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki crash IDE yang terjadi saat skrip helloworld ditulis ulang untuk"
" sensor yang terhubung; berkas kini dimuat ulang dari disk alih-alih "
"memanggil ``setPlainText`` (\\ `5793b3120 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5793b3120>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:125
msgid ""
"Fixed Python paste indentation so pasted code is no longer over-indented "
"past the indentation level of the preceding line (`8622327d9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8622327d9>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki indentasi paste Python sehingga kode yang ditempelkan tidak lagi"
" memiliki indentasi berlebih melampaui level indentasi baris sebelumnya (\\ "
"`8622327d9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8622327d9>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:128
msgid ""
"Fixed the output (serial terminal) pane so it is restored to its "
"visible/hidden state on startup, and stopped a context-menu popup on its "
"toggle buttons (`a972ecdf5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a972ecdf5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki panel output (terminal serial) sehingga dipulihkan ke keadaan "
"terlihat/tersembunyi saat startup, dan menghentikan popup menu konteks pada "
"tombol toggle-nya (\\ `a972ecdf5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a972ecdf5>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:132
msgid ""
"Fixed Alif device serial-port detection on macOS by only considering "
"``/dev/cu*`` ports and prefixing non-Windows port names with ``/dev/`` "
"(`277fe0c05 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/277fe0c05>`__, "
"`3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki deteksi port serial perangkat Alif di macOS dengan hanya "
"mempertimbangkan port ``/dev/cu*`` dan menambahkan prefiks ``/dev/`` pada "
"nama port non-Windows (\\ `277fe0c05 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/277fe0c05>`__\\ , `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:138
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Platform and tool support"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:140
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:141
msgid ""
"The **GENX320** event camera is now recognized for the ``01-Camera/03-Event-"
"Cameras`` example set, so GENX320 boards see those examples (`7fd3c141c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7fd3c141c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Kamera event **GENX320** kini dikenali untuk set contoh "
"``01-Camera/03-Event-Cameras``\\ , sehingga board GENX320 dapat melihat "
"contoh tersebut (\\ `7fd3c141c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7fd3c141c>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:145
msgid ""
"Added bundled Alif flashing tools (``share/qtcreator/alif`` version 1.100.0 "
"for linux-x86_64, mac, and windows) and a new ``OPENMV_AE3`` recovery "
"firmware/bootloader package, used internally by the AE3 firmware load and "
"recovery flow."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan alat flashing Alif yang dibundel (\\ ``share/qtcreator/alif`` "
"versi 1.100.0 untuk linux-x86_64, mac, dan windows) dan paket "
"firmware/bootloader pemulihan ``OPENMV_AE3`` baru, yang digunakan secara "
"internal oleh alur pemuatan firmware dan pemulihan AE3."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:149
msgid "OpenMV IDE version bumped from 4.4.4 to 4.4.5."
msgstr "Versi OpenMV IDE ditingkatkan dari 4.4.4 menjadi 4.4.5."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:152
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:154
msgid "User-visible workflow changes between v4.4.4 and v4.4.5:"
msgstr "Perubahan alur kerja yang terlihat pengguna antara v4.4.4 dan v4.4.5:"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:156
msgid ""
"The **CNN Network Library** entry under the ``Machine Vision Tools`` menu "
"(which let you copy a ``.tflite``/``.network``/``.txt`` model file directly "
"to the OpenMV Cam) was removed, and the camera ``Configure Settings`` dialog"
" action is now hidden. Users relying on those menu items will no longer find"
" them."
msgstr ""
"Entri **CNN Network Library** di bawah menu ``Machine Vision Tools`` (yang "
"memungkinkan Anda menyalin berkas model ``.tflite``\\ /\\ ``.network``\\ /\\"
" ``.txt`` langsung ke OpenMV Cam) telah dihapus, dan aksi dialog kamera "
"``Configure Settings`` kini disembunyikan. Pengguna yang mengandalkan item "
"menu tersebut tidak akan menemukannya lagi."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:161
msgid ""
"The command-line options ``-settingspath``, ``-installsettingspath``, "
"``-pluginpath``, and ``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs`` are no longer "
"accepted by the application (only ``-language`` remains). Scripts or "
"shortcuts relying on these flags will no longer take effect."
msgstr ""
"Opsi command-line ``-settingspath``\\ , ``-installsettingspath``\\ , "
"``-pluginpath``\\ , dan ``-temporarycleansettings``\\ /\\ ``-tcs`` tidak "
